Changes:
 tor (0.4.9.15-1~noble+1+tor41339.9) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Apply the tor#41339 HSDir defensive series (patches 0001-0020) on
     tor 0.4.9.15: HTTP and onion service descriptor hardening;
     MetricsPort counters for HSDir fetches and uploads, tunneled
     directory requests and response bytes by type and previous hop,
     circuits and BEGIN_DIR cells by previous hop and by source and
     descriptor per minute; the HSDirRefuseUnknownPrevHop and
     HSDirFetchShedding defenses, both off by default; restore
     doc/nofooter.conf. The same options and MetricsPort series as
     +tor41339.8, from a smaller series with the fixes from its review.
